 "transcript": {
  "visible_text": "Sundays Suck for Bitcoin - Daily Strategy\nBitcoin / U.S. Dollar \u00b7 1D \u00b7 BITSTAMP\nClose entry(s) order Sell on Saturday\nBuy on good Tuesday\nS\nW\n+1\n-1\nTradingView\nBitcoin tends to have bad Sundays, so this strategy just sells on Saturday, and buys back the next Wednesday if the price is kinda going up!\n(The strategy works best if you set your chart time period to 1 day.)",
